    forestStory2: "After hours of tracking, you reach a <span class='highlight'>fork in the path</span>. Three routes lie before you, each more treacherous than the last. The dragon's trail is faint, but you can sense the dark magic that clings to the air — a lingering residue of the Superlord's power.",
