    villageStory2: "You need <span class='highlight'>supplies</span> for the final leg of your journey. The Superlord's fortress lies just beyond the next ridge, and you cannot face him on an empty stomach or without proper equipment. But the villagers are wary of strangers, and the Superlord's spies are everywhere.",
