    mountainStory1: "The <span class='danger'>Shadowpeak Mountains</span> rise before you like the jagged teeth of some ancient, slumbering giant. At their summit, barely visible through the perpetual storm clouds, stands the <span class='magic'>Fortress of Malachar</span> — a monument to darkness carved into the living rock.",
