    superlordStory1: "The <span class='danger'>throne room</span> of Malachar is a cathedral of darkness. Pillars of black stone rise into shadow, and the air itself seems to pulse with <span class='magic'>malevolent energy</span>. At the far end of the hall, upon a throne of bones and twisted metal, sits <span class='magic'>Superlord Malachar</span> himself.",
    superlordStory2: "He is not what you expected. He is not a towering monster or a grotesque beast. He is <span class='highlight'>beautiful</span> — terrifyingly so. Pale skin, silver hair, eyes like twin voids that swallow the light. He wears robes of deepest purple, and around his neck hangs the <span class='magic'>Amulet of Domination</span> — the source of his control over the dragons.",
    superlordStory3: "\"So,\" he says, his voice a velvet whisper that somehow fills the entire chamber. \"Another <span class='danger'>hero</span> crawls into my domain. How... <span class='highlight'>delightful</span>.\"",
