    superlordStory7: "\"You wish to challenge my <span class='danger'>will</span>,\" he whispers. \"Then challenge it properly. Fill <span class='highlight'>twenty lines</span> before I fill mine, and the amulet belongs to you. Lose... and the dragon never flies again.\"",
