    bossfightStory2: "\"Your battlefield,\" Malachar murmurs, settling back into his throne. \"<span class='highlight'>Twenty lines</span> before me, and you live. Fill your own grid, <span class='highlight'>hero</span>. I am very old, and I have all the time in the world.\"",
